WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:02,930
For babies, don’t stretch your dirty paws

2
00:00:02,930 --> 00:00:06,990
Grandpa, you are big. Grandma, you are big.

3
00:00:06,990 --> 00:00:08,990
I was a soldier when I was young

4
00:00:08,990 --> 00:00:10,830
I gave birth to two more goddam sons.

5
00:00:10,830 --> 00:00:12,670
Finally have a granddaughter

6
00:00:12,670 --> 00:00:15,690
Grandpa cried all over

7
00:00:15,690 --> 00:00:19,210
Baby, grandpa’s eyes hurt from looking at the computer too much.

8
00:00:19,210 --> 00:00:21,250
Grandma will wrap up the doll later.

9
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:23,730
Take it with you wherever you go, okay okay?

10
00:00:23,730 --> 00:00:26,170
Brother, look, the old man can’t shovel the hole anymore.

11
00:00:26,170 --> 00:00:32,100
Calling today

12
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:34,740
Baby, uncle said baby caught the doll

13
00:00:34,740 --> 00:00:36,260
Why didn't dad see it?

14
00:00:38,220 --> 00:00:40,780
Baby, grandma, help you flip the camera

15
00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:42,340
No baby

16
00:00:42,340 --> 00:00:45,790
Then turn back, the doll is behind the baby

17
00:00:45,790 --> 00:00:48,310
Baby, go see what uncle is doing

18
00:00:48,310 --> 00:00:50,630
Uncle is disobedient. Help dad watch uncle.

19
00:00:50,630 --> 00:00:53,550
Uncle is disobedient and has a bad heart.

20
00:00:53,550 --> 00:00:55,270
Dad, I'm an adult

21
00:00:55,270 --> 00:00:56,630
I like people who make their own decisions

22
00:00:56,630 --> 00:00:57,870
You decide

23
00:00:57,870 --> 00:00:59,870
You make the decision to help his bad gambling father pay off his debts

24
00:00:59,870 --> 00:01:01,630
Get lost. I won’t give you a penny.

25
00:01:01,630 --> 00:01:14,620
Grandpa, grandpa, sleep with wine. Your eyes are good and your body is good.

26
00:01:14,620 --> 00:01:16,220
Why is the baby so considerate?

27
00:01:16,260 --> 00:01:17,540
Baby is so good

28
00:01:17,540 --> 00:01:18,660
Grandpa is going to bed now
